In AI SDK v7, `{ type: 'image', image }` is deprecated. Use the new `file` part type with an image media type instead:

```ts
{
  type: 'file',
  mediaType: 'image' | 'image/png' | 'image/jpeg' /* etc */,
  data: /* image data as base64 string, Uint8Array, ArrayBuffer, Buffer, URL, or ProviderReference */
}
```

Examples:

```ts
